<title>NETHERLANDS: Wesselius upgrades BESI to Buy from Hold.</title>
<headline>Wesselius upgrades BESI to Buy from Hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 17 research.</p>
<p>Company-----------------------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    BE Semiconductor Industries   27.50   Wesselius</p>
<p>COMMENT: Upgrading recommendation to Buy from Hold.</p>
<p>Threefold benefits to BESI which will take 30 pct stake in new PBE leadframe venture with German and Asian partners. -- PBE will be in world Top 10 in leadframe market; self-financing of leadframe business will allow investments elsewhere; and broader customer base. Leadframe market also picked up in Q4'96.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   1.47	-	  -	   -</p>
<p>    1997		   1.74	-	 15.3	 -</p>
<p>    1998		   2.30	-	 11.6	 -</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
